{
  "name": "Enrich websites in Google Sheets with their tech stack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Enrich a list of websites with their tech stack\nReads domains from column **domain** of a sheet, detects each site's technologies (CMS, ecommerce, analytics, ads, CRM, email, CDN) and writes them back next to the domain. Good for lead lists: find Shopify stores, HubSpot users or sites without analytics.\n\n**Setup (2 minutes)**\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your API token (Apify Console > Settings > API & Integrations).\n2. Add an n8n *Header Auth* credential named **Apify API token**: header `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n3. Connect Google Sheets. Tab **Domains** needs a header row with a **domain** column.\n4. Click *Test workflow*. Up to 100 domains per run.\n\nCost: [Website Tech Stack Detector](https://apify.com/artificially/website-tech-stack-detector) charges $0.05 per run plus $15 per 1,000 domains.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "c74d376b-2f91-40ef-93e4-46251175c3d7",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
